<title>GERMANY: Berlin govt clears Berliner bank, NordLB merger.</title>
<headline>Berlin govt clears Berliner bank, NordLB merger.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Berlin senate said on Monday it had approved the merger of Berliner Bankgesellschaft and NordLB, and the fusion was expected to take place by the end of 1997.</p>
<p>The senate had given the &quot;official green light&quot; for the merger to proceed, and the negotiations between the two banks were expected to continue through most of this year, a senate spokesman said.</p>
</text>
